      "name": "按对象域导航",
      "basis": "QUANTOS_EXTENSION",
      "sourceRefs": [
        "SRC-01"
      ],
      "terminalSpec": "docs/SumAlpha-QuantOS-Terminal-Frontend-Design-Spec.md#tp10-vc-01",
      "surface": "P01–P23 / App Shell",
      "owner": "U01",
      "decision": "REIMPLEMENT_PATTERN_ONLY",
      "implementationStatus": "NOT_ASSESSED",
      "differenceRefs": [
        "D01",
        "D10"
      ],
      "requirement": "对象域导航保留路由、资源权限和返回上下文；不得新增上游四工作区或自动交易入口。",
      "acceptance": "验证直接深链、无权限菜单、返回筛选状态。"
    },
    {
      "id": "VC-02",
      "name": "研究输入与产物双区",
      "basis": "DOCUMENTED",
      "sourceRefs": [
        "SRC-02"
      ],
      "terminalSpec": "docs/SumAlpha-QuantOS-Terminal-Frontend-Design-Spec.md#tp10-vc-02",
      "surface": "P03 / P04",
      "owner": "U01",
      "decision": "REIMPLEMENT_PATTERN_ONLY",
      "implementationStatus": "NOT_ASSESSED",
      "differenceRefs": [
        "D03",
        "D10"
      ],
      "requirement": "研究使用受控 Composer；流式中间输出与最终 ResearchArtifact 分区，证据固定可见。",
      "acceptance": "断线补齐、sequence 去重、取消须服务端确认；中间文本不可呈现为最终结论。"
    },
    {
      "id": "VC-03",
      "name": "结论到证据下钻",
      "basis": "QUANTOS_EXTENSION",
      "sourceRefs": [
        "SRC-02"
      ],
      "terminalSpec": "docs/SumAlpha-QuantOS-Terminal-Frontend-Design-Spec.md#tp10-vc-03",
      "surface": "P04 / P05 / P12",
      "owner": "U01",
      "decision": "REIMPLEMENT_PATTERN_ONLY",
      "implementationStatus": "NOT_ASSESSED",
      "differenceRefs": [
        "D03",
        "D10"
      ],
      "requirement": "列表→Research详情→Artifact/快照→Audit；面包屑与返回栈保留过滤条件。",
      "acceptance": "键盘可达证据；权限拒绝不泄漏存在性；hash/lineage/关联ID可核对。"
    },
    {
      "id": "VC-04",
      "name": "历史时间线",
      "basis": "ROADMAP",
      "sourceRefs": [
        "SRC-05"
      ],
      "terminalSpec": "docs/SumAlpha-QuantOS-Terminal-Frontend-Design-Spec.md#tp10-vc-04",
      "surface": "P04 / P12",
      "owner": "U01",
      "decision": "REIMPLEMENT_PATTERN_ONLY",
      "implementationStatus": "NOT_ASSESSED",
      "differenceRefs": [
        "D03",
        "D10"
      ],
      "requirement": "时间线显示版本、content hash、时间、主体与关联ID；去重不覆盖历史。",
      "acceptance": "重复事件去重；版本变化和证据失效可见；原始字段按权限脱敏。"
    },
    {
      "id": "VC-05",
      "name": "标的筛选到详情",
      "basis": "DOCUMENTED",
      "sourceRefs": [
        "SRC-03"
      ],
      "terminalSpec": "docs/SumAlpha-QuantOS-Terminal-Frontend-Design-Spec.md#tp10-vc-05",
      "surface": "P03 / P18 / P19",
      "owner": "U01",
      "decision": "REIMPLEMENT_PATTERN_ONLY",
      "implementationStatus": "NOT_ASSESSED",
      "differenceRefs": [
        "D05",
        "D10",
        "D06"
      ],
      "requirement": "筛选与排序同步 URL；以 QuantOS 数据来源、许可、时效为准，Signal 展示引用与诊断。",
      "acceptance": "返回恢复条件；Stale/Unavailable 不伪装 Live；无许可只显示最小元数据。"
    },
    {
      "id": "VC-06",
      "name": "实验参数与结果对比",
      "basis": "QUANTOS_EXTENSION",
      "sourceRefs": [
        "SRC-02"
      ],
      "terminalSpec": "docs/SumAlpha-QuantOS-Terminal-Frontend-Design-Spec.md#tp10-vc-06",
      "surface": "P06 / P07",
      "owner": "S02",
      "decision": "REIMPLEMENT_PATTERN_ONLY",
      "implementationStatus": "NOT_ASSESSED",
      "differenceRefs": [
        "D04",
        "D10"
      ],
      "requirement": "参数、快照、Engine版本、成本和结果表并列；只创建草稿/回测或发布候选。",
      "acceptance": "失败验证阻断候选；历史结果不可改；回测不得提供自动实盘动作。"
    },
    {
      "id": "VC-07",
      "name": "多观点对比",
      "basis": "QUANTOS_EXTENSION",
      "sourceRefs": [
        "SRC-02"
      ],
      "terminalSpec": "docs/SumAlpha-QuantOS-Terminal-Frontend-Design-Spec.md#tp10-vc-07",
      "surface": "P09 / P10",
      "owner": "X06",
      "decision": "REIMPLEMENT_PATTERN_ONLY",
      "implementationStatus": "NOT_ASSESSED",
      "differenceRefs": [
        "D04",
        "D10"
      ],
      "requirement": "supporting/counter views 并列显示及各自证据，Proposal 默认为 executable=false。",
      "acceptance": "无证据观点标明不足；分歧不转为投票交易授权；到期或 policy 变化需刷新。"
    },
    {
      "id": "VC-08",
      "name": "统一状态语言",
      "basis": "QUANTOS_EXTENSION",
      "sourceRefs": [
        "SRC-01"
      ],
      "terminalSpec": "docs/SumAlpha-QuantOS-Terminal-Frontend-Design-Spec.md#tp10-vc-08",
      "surface": "§3.2 / P04 / P05 / P09",
      "owner": "U01",
      "decision": "REIMPLEMENT_PATTERN_ONLY",
      "implementationStatus": "NOT_ASSESSED",
      "differenceRefs": [
        "D03",
        "D10"
      ],
      "requirement": "文本+图标+颜色呈现任务、expired proposal、stale snapshot、degraded engine。",
      "acceptance": "过期原因/时间可读，禁用动作给出原因；前端不得覆盖服务端状态。"
    },
    {
      "id": "VC-09",
      "name": "详情分区与原始字段",
      "basis": "QUANTOS_EXTENSION",
      "sourceRefs": [
        "SRC-02"
      ],
      "terminalSpec": "docs/SumAlpha-QuantOS-Terminal-Frontend-Design-Spec.md#tp10-vc-09",
      "surface": "P04 / P09 / P11 / P12",
      "owner": "U01",
      "decision": "REIMPLEMENT_PATTERN_ONLY",
      "implementationStatus": "NOT_ASSESSED",
      "differenceRefs": [
        "D03",
        "D10"
      ],
      "requirement": "概览、证据、审批、原始JSON分区；原始字段折叠且脱敏，资源权限一致。",
      "acceptance": "各分区键盘导航；未授权字段不得加载；原始内容不可绕过BFF直接执行。"
    },
    {
      "id": "VC-10",
      "name": "空态与下一步",
      "basis": "QUANTOS_EXTENSION",
      "sourceRefs": [
        "SRC-01"
      ],
      "terminalSpec": "docs/SumAlpha-QuantOS-Terminal-Frontend-Design-Spec.md#tp10-vc-10",
      "surface": "§3.2 / P03 / P06",
      "owner": "U01",
      "decision": "REIMPLEMENT_PATTERN_ONLY",
      "implementationStatus": "NOT_ASSESSED",
      "differenceRefs": [
        "D07",
        "D10"
      ],
      "requirement": "空、加载、失败、无权限分别显示原因和获准的下一步。",
      "acceptance": "无权限不可引导绕过；空态创建研究遵守快照/预算/deadline限制。"
    },
    {
      "id": "VC-11",
      "name": "通知与降级",
      "basis": "ROADMAP",
      "sourceRefs": [
        "SRC-04"
      ],
      "terminalSpec": "docs/SumAlpha-QuantOS-Terminal-Frontend-Design-Spec.md#tp10-vc-11",
      "surface": "P15 / P16 / P17 / P23",
      "owner": "X06",
      "decision": "REIMPLEMENT_PATTERN_ONLY",
      "implementationStatus": "NOT_ASSESSED",
      "differenceRefs": [
        "D08",
        "D10"
      ],
      "requirement": "Web授权拒绝降级页面内；桌面遵守系统设置；通知只含脱敏摘要与安全深链。",
      "acceptance": "拒绝授权、离线和重复通知可恢复；通知不可批准、签名或提交交易。"
    },
    {
      "id": "VC-12",
      "name": "隐私与数据驻留展示",
      "basis": "DOCUMENTED",
      "sourceRefs": [
        "SRC-01",
        "SRC-06"
      ],
      "terminalSpec": "docs/SumAlpha-QuantOS-Terminal-Frontend-Design-Spec.md#tp10-vc-12",
      "surface": "P14 / P15 / P16",
      "owner": "U01",
      "decision": "REIMPLEMENT_PATTERN_ONLY",
      "implementationStatus": "NOT_ASSESSED",
      "differenceRefs": [
        "D09",
        "D10",
        "D02",
        "D06"
      ],
      "requirement": "展示实际数据驻留、缓存、遥测策略与数据权利；不得承诺所有业务数据仅在本机。",
      "acceptance": "明确 Supabase/BFF 远端处理；离线只读；不得在设置页保存生产密钥。"
    }
  ],
